module

public import ReasLib.AlgebraicGeometry.RingedSpace.Module.GeneratingSections.Tensor
import StacksCheckRecall

@[expose] public section

open CategoryTheory
open AlgebraicGeometry

/- Lemma 17.4.3 (01AO): the tensor product of two module sheaves generated by global
sections is generated by global sections. -/
@[stacks 01AO]
#check @SheafOfModules.IsGloballyGenerated.tensor

/- The underlying existence statement is available when a proof needs chosen generators. -/
#check @SheafOfModules.GeneratingSections.nonempty_tensor

/- Chosen generating families tensor to an explicit family indexed by their product. -/
#check @SheafOfModules.GeneratingSections.tensor

/- Tensoring finite generating families preserves finiteness of the chosen family. -/
#check @SheafOfModules.GeneratingSections.tensor_isFiniteType

/- The algebraic spanning theorem used by the geometric construction is available independently. -/
#check @TensorProduct.span_range_tmul_eq_top
